    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Sunrise on Mowbray Mountain is at 07:23 and sunset at 19:08, giving drivers an 11‑hour‑45‑minute day to explore.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.trawellino.com/destinations/united-states/tennessee_mowbray-mountain"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The park works to protect historic structures, landscapes, and artifacts that tell the varied stories of people who once called these mountains home.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.nps.gov/grsm/learn/historyculture/index.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Great Smoky Mountains National Park preserves a rich cultural tapestry of Southern Appalachian history, and Mowbray Mountain is a key part of that legacy.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
